flowchart LR
  B[Browser KeyboardSandbox\nSanitized metadata only] --> T[POST /api/telemetry\nUUID + sequence validation]
  B --> A[POST /api/analytics\nFeature snapshot]
  T --> S[(PostgreSQL\nusers / sessions / events)]
  A --> P[TypeScript policy boundary\nAuthenticated account scope]
  P --> M[Python ML service\nVersioned Isolation Forest]
  M --> P
  P --> D[(PostgreSQL\nanalytics / assessments)]
  P --> R{Risk policy}
  R -->|low or baseline| E[(PostgreSQL\naudit log)]
  R -->|high or critical| L[(PostgreSQL\nsecurity alert)]
  L --> E
  P --> X[Redis pub/sub]
  X --> V[Authenticated SSE]
  V --> U[SaaS dashboard\nanalytics + security views]

  classDef private fill:#e8f0e1,stroke:#566b3b,color:#1c2818;
  classDef service fill:#f5f1e8,stroke:#8f7b5a,color:#30281e;
  class B,T,A,P,R,V,U private;
  class M,X service;
